<title>ITALY: RALLYING-SAN REMO RALLY RESULT.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-SAN REMO RALLY RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>SAN REMO, Italy 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading leading placings</p>
<p>in the San Remo rally which ended on Wednesday:</p>
<p>1. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru Impreza 4 hours 26 minutes 57</p>
<p>seconds</p>
<p>2. Carlos Sainz (Spain)  Ford Escort Cosworth 22 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Bruno Thiry (Belgium) Ford Escort Cosworth	    2:09</p>
<p> 4. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru Impreza		2:44</p>
<p> 5. Freddie Loix (Belgium) Toyota Celica GT4		2:51</p>
<p> 6. Franco Cunico (Italy) Ford Escort Cosworth	    3:44</p>
<p> 7. Gilberto Pianezzola (Italy) Toyota Celica GT4	 4:01</p>
<p> 8. Didier Auriol (France) Mitsubishi Lancer		4:53</p>
<p> 9. Angelo Medeghini (Italy) Subaru Impreza		 8:02</p>
<p> 10. Patrick Bernardini (France) Ford Escort Cosworth   8:02</p>
<p>Leading world drivers' championship standings:</p>
<p>1. Tommi Makinen (Finland)  115 points - world champion</p>
<p> 2. Sainz			   89</p>
<p> 3. Eriksson			74</p>
<p> 4. McRae			   72</p>
<p> 5. Piero Liatti (Italy)	41</p>
<p>Manufacturers standings:</p>
<p> 1. Subaru			 337 points</p>
<p> 2. Mitsubishi		   304</p>
<p> 3. Ford			   274</p>
<p>Final round: Catalunya Rally, November 4 to 6.</p>
